# Tells the session this unit was renamed and how to move an install, because
# the platform can't rename an installed plugin (ADR-2300).
cat <<'NOTICE'
meow-verbs is now meow-checks. This copy is a stub with no skill and no program.
Move the install with:

  claude plugin install meow-checks@meowpaw
  claude plugin uninstall meow-verbs@meowpaw

Your profile's [verbs] table and the five verb names stay as they are.
The release after meow-checks 0.9.0 removes this stub.
NOTICE
